Removed rather than kept as an optional backend: its one advantage (no key) did not survive the real video, where it turned 熊谷真奈 into 'the Bay of Bengal' / 'valle de Kumano' / 'कुमा घाटी', and it has no glossary or context support to fix that. gpt is the default over google because it is the only backend that uses the glossary and video context, which is what got the name right. transformers stays a dependency (via whisperx) because the wav2vec2 word alignment needs it, so dropping nllb saves the model download, not the package. Changing the translate stage's settings list re-translates existing work folders once.
